{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "marian.meet",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "効きすぎる救護室",
  "summary": "紙で切った指を診せに行ったら、癖毛と三年前の古傷まで治った",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.marian",
    "characterId": "marian",
    "stage": "meet"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "rest",
      "work"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 500,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "救護室",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "marian.meet.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-infirmary-day-v1.png",
        "alt": "救護室の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "marian.meet.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/marian-meet-fingertip-v2.png",
        "alt": "救護室でミミの指先の傷を治すマリアン"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "marian.meet.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "伝票の紙で、うっかり指を切った。深さ一ミリ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "絆創膏で十分な傷だけど、在庫切れ。初めて、救護室へ行った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それが、間違いというか、正解というか、事件の始まりだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "救護室の主は、金糸の治癒陣を編む、静かな人だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マリアンと名乗った彼女は、私の指を一目見て、手のひらをかざした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、思わずぴんと立つ。淡い光。三秒。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "marian.meet.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "指の傷が、消えた。ついでに、三年前の火傷の痕と、昨日からの肩こりまで消えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今朝どうしても直らなかった癖毛まで。……癖毛まで?",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……申し訳ありません。また、効きすぎました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "範囲の設定が、その、大きすぎるのです。生まれつき。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見れば、待合の患者さんたちも、次々と完治していた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "骨折のお客様が三十秒でギプスを外し、風邪の清掃係さんが鼻歌で帰っていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "効きすぎる救護室。うちの施設で、一番ありがたく、一番謎の部屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そして、事件が起きた。私の鞄から、お土産の袋が覗いていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "中身は、途中でうっかり割ってしまったクッキー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マリアンの視線がそこを通った瞬間——ぴき、と音がして、割れ目が消えた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……菓子まで、治してしまった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……すみません。壊れているものを見ると、手が、勝手に。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "謝ることじゃ……いえ、でも、今、少し辛そうな顔をしました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……治すことは、いつも正しいとは、限らないので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "割れたクッキーには、割れた時の思い出ごと食べる食べ方が、あったかもしれません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "何でも治せる人が、治すことを怖がっている。その横顔の理由を、私はまだ、何も知らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただ、帰り際に見えた。救護室の一番奥、使われていないベッドが一台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今朝も丁寧に整えられ、枕元には死者用の白い包帯が、几帳面に畳まれていた。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰も来ないベッドを、毎朝整える人の手つきは、治癒陣より雄弁だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は割れ目の消えたクッキーを一枚、そっと診察台に置いた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "これ、お礼です。治療費、取ってくれないみたいなので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ちなみに、治ってても割って食べられますよ。クッキーは。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マリアンは、少しだけ目を見開いて、それから今日初めて、ちゃんと笑った。割ればいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "marian.meet.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "治っても、また割ればいいだけ。その単純な答えが、この人には新しかったらしい。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "marian.meet.choice.001",
          "label": "包帯を畳みながら効きすぎる話を聞く",
          "result": "閉室まで、包帯を畳みながら話を聞いた。範囲が大きすぎて治したくないものまで治ること。だから人混みが苦手なこと。畳み終えた山を見て、彼女は言った。「治さない時間が、できるのですね」その言葉を、私は覚えて帰った。",
          "intent": "力の話を、本人の速度で聞く",
          "promise": "目先の報酬は得ない代わりに、この人が何を恐れているかを知る。",
          "memory": "包帯を一緒に畳んだ夕方を、マリアンは覚えている。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "marian"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 7,
              "ownership": -2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "marian.meet.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "marian.meet.choice.002",
          "label": "今日はマリアンを誘わず、用事へ戻る",
          "result": "仕事に戻ると、同僚たちが騒いでいた。「肌つやが良くなってない？」救護室帰りは隠せないらしい。翌日、貼り紙が出た。「治したくない箇所がある方は、お申し出ください」あの人の丁寧さは、貼り紙にも効いている。",
          "intent": "今日は業務へ戻る",
          "promise": "所属選手にはならないが、後の出来事で再会できる。",
          "memory": "クッキーを置いていった店員のことを、マリアンは覚えている。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "marian.meet.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "markEncountered",
          "fighterId": "marian",
          "encountered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "setStoryStage",
          "fighterId": "marian",
          "stage": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "marian.meet.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
